Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Repository Slice Observation P0 Threat Review

@ [threat_review_uuid] 89a87356-a3b2-4ea1-a895-ef1ad857d85d
@ [canonical_uuid] f1fd1689-f290-4be6-ad82-e36d58103e1b

& [Threats]
  + executable substitution repository symlink branch or HEAD race replace objects filters attributes config credentials prompts lazy fetch hooks and file protocol can widen observation
  + option-like paths malformed NUL output path alias duplicate path symbolic link submodule unsupported mode and object-format confusion can substitute content
  + oversized outputs blobs commit index command count timeout stderr and process failure can exhaust or obscure accounting
  + dirty working-tree bytes can be mistaken for committed bytes and physical process reads can be falsely reported as parent zero effects

& [Controls]
  + absolute canonical no-follow executable SHA before after cleared environment disabled ambient Git features exact allowlist double dash raw ls-tree and cat-file only
  + exact path-set equality mode type object-width raw-byte SHA pre-post repository identity index and executable checks closed bounds and fail-closed whole receipt
  + explicit physical_contact and separate read-only accounts with all writes network provider model and remote effects denied

& [Residual]
  + trust remains limited to the supplied hash-pinned Git executable host kernel filesystem and exact run; no global host integrity claim is made
